{"id":"signo","lemma":"signo","pos":"noun","rank":2588,"glosses":["sign, indication"],"ipa":"/ˈsiɡno/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"signos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-signo.wav","examples":[{"text":"No hay signos de infección.","en":"There's no sign of infection.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581611","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"infection"}]},{"text":"Un cabeceo es un signo de acuerdo.","en":"A nod is a sign of agreement.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804097","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"agreed"]]},{"text":"¿Conoces el lenguaje de signos?","en":"Are you familiar with sign language?","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"language"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Estudié su cara buscando signos de agotamiento.","en":"I studied his face for signs of weariness.","words":[{"g":"to study","l":"estudiar"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"face"},{"g":"to seek","l":"buscar"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"exhaustion, depletion"}]},{"text":"Tom no entendía lo que significaba el signo.","en":"Tom couldn't understand what the sign meant.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801930","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to understand","l":"entender"},null,null,{"g":"to signify","l":"significar"},{"g":"the"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"what, that which"]]}]}